# The account's OAuth token has no `workflow` scope, and GitHub rejects the WHOLE push —
# card images included — if any commit touches this path. One such commit silently blocked
# every push on the branch, which would have left Instagram and Pinterest fetching nothing
# forever. Ignored so it cannot be staged by accident. To switch to Actions:
#   gh auth refresh -s workflow  &&  git add -f .github/workflows/daily-social.yml
